  ('English Speaking Fundamentals', 'ENG101', 'English Speaking Fundamentals is a practical, beginner-friendly course designed to build confident, fluent spoken English for everyday and professional contexts. Through guided conversation, pronunciation drills, and real-world scenarios, you will develop the communication skills needed to express yourself clearly and naturally.', 'Global Languages & Communication', 'published', 'public', now(), now()),
