SELECT course_id, title, description, position FROM candidates;

-- Publish one structured lesson per module; preserve any existing authored lesson content.
WITH seed(code, title, content, position) AS (VALUES
  ('ENG101', 'English Speaking Fundamentals: Diagnostic profile and communication goals', '## English Speaking Fundamentals: Diagnostic profile and communication goals

Identify the learner’s baseline, intended audience and real communication contexts. Establish measurable targets for accuracy, fluency, comprehension and confidence.

### Learning outcomes
1. Work addresses the stated task and intended audience.
2. Method or decisions are explained and evidence is traceable.
3. Relevant quality, safety, ethics and accessibility checks are documented.

### Guided learning activities
1. Complete a baseline task and set three measurable learning goals.
2. Short retrieval check: learner explains one key concept without notes.
3. Peer/instructor feedback using the stated success criteria.

### Evidence of learning
Baseline sample with self-assessment and goals.

### Suggested study time
3 hours', 1),
  ('ENG101', 'English Speaking Fundamentals: Core forms, vocabulary and meaning', '## English Speaking Fundamentals: Core forms, vocabulary and meaning

